539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov","html_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":1915,"digest":"sha256:6f00c9b82c4b5743a5d4ecedf8d1e5b93c68376785c1e93c299b9c23dc8f724d","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-09-22T14:23:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T14:23:28Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/download/v0.82.1/verification.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/tarball/v0.82.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/zipball/v0.82.1","body":"## RevealLine v0.82.1 — preserve session-only Journey originals\n\nThis patch keeps uninterrupted Journey play truthful when another tab owns saving or the profile writer is already unavailable.\n\n- Retains exact earned and successor picture originals in bounded tab memory so Next can continue without another Start action.\n- Preserves won result artwork through delayed preparation, Retry, earned Collection views and return focus.\n- Adds an explicit `.rlmedia` preparation and download path for session originals, separate from game-data JSON, with exact additive restoration through the existing Workshop flow.\n- Keeps durable-write failures strict: failed or uncertain writes never silently become session-only success.\n- Limits accepted plus pending originals to 32 MiB with no silent eviction, and keeps late or cancelled preparation from exposing stale downloads.\n- Splits the four existing whole-original Journey traversal scenarios into independent hosted test entries without changing their assertions.\n\nSource: `64ec9fd2e5688f4248fe005ac6a47c0c1394ea9e`, tree `402f5f12d83cb86dbceb9d9dceec12731ea48980`.\n\nQualification: merged-source [run 35729850339](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35729850339) passed all six source gates, all four shards (11,722 tests across 894 files), production checks and immutable freeze. Predecessor PR [run 35722144548](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35722144548) independently passed the same game/build/test inputs; its three publisher-only differences remain explicitly identified in the attached evidence. [Frozen inspection 35738838201](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35738838201) verified every source and distribution byte, plus the 896-file / 59,940,823-byte offline inventory.\n\nOriginal distribution: 590,546,744 bytes, SHA256 `eb98abe00155176d77facbcedcd1510219031057afc56a5669f98c7330b2b3af`. The nine attached original assets retain the frozen source, manifest, qualification and evidence. Pages publication and affected public browser acceptance are tracked separately in the delivery register.\n\nLimits: physical-device, complete cold-offline, browser-leave, acoustic soundtrack, and Ukrainian musical-authenticity reviews remain separate. This release does not include PR #252 or PR #253 and does not approve the paused generated soundtrack candidates.\n"}